OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies missing out on NHS money
OL,4,Afor healthy food
OL,5,
OL,6,FCharities are warning that thousands of
OL,7,Flow income families are missing out on
OL,8,Fmoney they are eligible to claim to buy
OL,9,Ffresh fruit, vegetables, and milk.
OL,11,FFamilies earning less than #400 a week
OL,12,Fare entitled to weekly NHS Health Start
OL,13,Fpayments including pregnant women and
OL,14,Fthose with children under four years
OL,15,Fold who are entitled to #4.65 a week.
OL,17,FFigures found take-up of the scheme is
OL,18,Fas low as 64% in some parts of the
OL,19,FNorth East and Cumbria.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
